        "data": {
          "comment": "# Podcast Episode to Show Notes\n\nTurns a recorded episode into show notes. You get a short summary, topic bullets and any resources mentioned.\n\n**How it works:** The \"Recording\" input goes to \"Extract audio\", and \"Transcribe\" converts the speech to English text. \"Agent\" writes a two-sentence summary, five topic bullets and the named resources, without inventing timestamps. \"Output\" shows the notes.\n\n**Try this:** Pick models on \"Transcribe\" and \"Agent\", then edit the system prompt on \"Agent\" to ask for three suggested episode titles as well."
        },
